    "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511730/extras/057bbcd75fa4dc64874a295c12ac4c05.avif?t=1752205855\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monstabox Demo Update!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spanish, Japanese, and Korean languages added</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game tutorial updated and improved</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can\u2019t remember what each spell or tool does?<br>Don\u2019t worry, just hover your mouse over the UI to refresh your memory!</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monstabox</strong> is a <strong>brand-new, turn-based 1v1 battle game</strong> that blends strategy with the excitement of action-packed combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your favorite monster and a set of spells, then roll your <strong>Monstabox</strong> across the board to attack, set up combos, and unleash your monster\u2019s ultimate moves to dominate the battlefield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511730/extras/1de00fe9094f86262f0b73d1db9576a0.poster.avif?t=1752205855\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511730/extras/1de00fe9094f86262f0b73d1db9576a0.webm?t=1752205855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511730/extras/1de00fe9094f86262f0b73d1db9576a0.mp4?t=1752205855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>fast-paced 3-minute battles</strong>, intense back-and-forth action, and thrilling comebacks, every match is a heart-pounding experience. Win or lose, you\u2019ll always want to tweak your strategy and play again\u2014this is gameplay like never before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511730/extras/3b10f93f58a942b5df27fc413ae8c4bd.poster.avif?t=1752205855\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511730/extras/3b10f93f58a942b5df27fc413ae8c4bd.webm?t=1752205855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511730/extras/3b10f93f58a942b5df27fc413ae8c4bd.mp4?t=1752205855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wait, wait! The match isn\u2019t over yet!</strong> <br>Defeating your opponent isn\u2019t enough\u2014Monstabox doesn\u2019t end there! When you KO your opponent, a <strong>Star</strong> appears on the board....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511730/extras/188a8e0b5ad259611ccf412d8ddabaaa.poster.avif?t=1752205855\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511730/extras/188a8e0b5ad259611ccf412d8ddabaaa.webm?t=1752205855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511730/extras/188a8e0b5ad259611ccf412d8ddabaaa.mp4?t=1752205855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player who activates the face of their Monstabox with the Star wins the match!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511730/extras/bb901b79a3a2987565c4783ff536a151.poster.avif?t=1752205855\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511730/extras/bb901b79a3a2987565c4783ff536a151.webm?t=1752205855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511730/extras/bb901b79a3a2987565c4783ff536a151.mp4?t=1752205855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play anywhere on <strong>PC, smartphone, or tablet</strong> with <strong>cross-platform and cross-progression support</strong>. Take on online battles to compete worldwide and become the ultimate champion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511730/extras/c76e56898f04f3be668e606de0b49088.avif?t=1752205855\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2714 Unique battle system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Strategic depth without overwhelming complexity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Fast-paced, no downtime gameplay\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Extra Game modes crafted for E-sports &amp; competitive communities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Distinct visual appeal &amp; broad audience reach</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Toy-like box and board game fee</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recommended for Players Who\u2026</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Love competitive and strategy games: Enjoy fast-paced battles and skill-based tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Enjoy deck-building games: Want to explore an intuitive and unique new system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Like casual &amp; party games: Want a game that\u2019s easy to pick up, fun in short sessions, but deep enough to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Are between 14 and 40 years old: A perfect balance of strategy and accessibility for all types of players!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monstabox</strong> is a <strong>brand-new, turn-based 1v1 battle game</strong> that blends strategy with the excitement of action-packed combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your favorite monster and a set of spells, then roll your <strong>Monstabox</strong> across the board to attack, set up combos, and unleash your monster\u2019s ultimate moves to dominate the battlefield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511730/extras/1de00fe9094f86262f0b73d1db9576a0.poster.avif?t=1752205855\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511730/extras/1de00fe9094f86262f0b73d1db9576a0.webm?t=1752205855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511730/extras/1de00fe9094f86262f0b73d1db9576a0.mp4?t=1752205855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>fast-paced 3-minute battles</strong>, intense back-and-forth action, and thrilling comebacks, every match is a heart-pounding experience. Win or lose, you\u2019ll always want to tweak your strategy and play again\u2014this is gameplay like never before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511730/extras/3b10f93f58a942b5df27fc413ae8c4bd.poster.avif?t=1752205855\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511730/extras/3b10f93f58a942b5df27fc413ae8c4bd.webm?t=1752205855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511730/extras/3b10f93f58a942b5df27fc413ae8c4bd.mp4?t=1752205855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wait, wait! The match isn\u2019t over yet!</strong> <br>Defeating your opponent isn\u2019t enough\u2014Monstabox doesn\u2019t end there! When you KO your opponent, a <strong>Star</strong> appears on the board....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511730/extras/188a8e0b5ad259611ccf412d8ddabaaa.poster.avif?t=1752205855\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511730/extras/188a8e0b5ad259611ccf412d8ddabaaa.webm?t=1752205855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511730/extras/188a8e0b5ad259611ccf412d8ddabaaa.mp4?t=1752205855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player who activates the face of their Monstabox with the Star wins the match!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511730/extras/bb901b79a3a2987565c4783ff536a151.poster.avif?t=1752205855\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511730/extras/bb901b79a3a2987565c4783ff536a151.webm?t=1752205855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511730/extras/bb901b79a3a2987565c4783ff536a151.mp4?t=1752205855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play anywhere on <strong>PC, smartphone, or tablet</strong> with <strong>cross-platform and cross-progression support</strong>. Take on online battles to compete worldwide and become the ultimate champion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511730/extras/c76e56898f04f3be668e606de0b49088.avif?t=1752205855\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2714 Unique battle system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Strategic depth without overwhelming complexity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Fast-paced, no downtime gameplay\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Extra Game modes crafted for E-sports &amp; competitive communities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Distinct visual appeal &amp; broad audience reach</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Toy-like box and board game fee</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recommended for Players Who\u2026</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Love competitive and strategy games: Enjoy fast-paced battles and skill-based tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Enjoy deck-building games: Want to explore an intuitive and unique new system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Like casual &amp; party games: Want a game that\u2019s easy to pick up, fun in short sessions, but deep enough to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Are between 14 and 40 years old: A perfect balance of strategy and accessibility for all types of players!</p>",
